observed = "Five tests passed; two fixture validations returned ProfileMissing after the mistaken profile removal, and AP2 persistence treated the HTTP response envelope as bare hex. One task-scoped repair restores and validates the profile and decodes the stored envelope without weakening any behavioral assertion."

